        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use the following description of a galvanic cell to answer the questions that follow."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "x1rdr4dnp5w8vui",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "One half-cell consists of a piece of Pt metal submerged in a solution of Pt(NO"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ")"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", and the other half-cell consists of a piece of Cu metal submerged in a solution of Cu(NO"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ")"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". When the cell operates, Pt is formed and Cu is consumed."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "hzp0wre79aikl6v",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "id": "635186635",
